<h1>A renamed gateway, streaming providers and bounded jobs</h1>
<p>The gateway is now <code>dekopon-gatewayd</code>. Since 0.26, providers gained streamed input and output, while shell workflows gained background jobs and child scripts that keep the caller's limits.</p>
</header>
